    {
      "name": "LynxViewElement",
      "kind": "interface",
      "type": "unknown",
      "examples": [
        "HTML Example\n\nNote that you should declarae the size of lynx-view\n\n```html\n<lynx-view url=\"https://path/to/main.web.bundle\" init-data=\"{}\" global-props=\"{}\" style=\"height:300px;width:300px\">\n</lynx-view>\n```\n\nReact 19 Example\n```jsx\n<lynx-view url={myLynxCardUrl} initData={{}} globalProps={{}} style={{height:'300px', width:'300px'}}>\n</lynx-view>\n```"
      ],
      "members": [
        {
          "name": "injectStyleRules",
          "optional": true,
          "type": "string[]",
          "summary": "[optional] the css rules which will be injected into shadowroot. Each items will be inserted by `insertRule` method.",
          "kind": "property"
        },
        {
          "name": "napiModulesMap",
          "type": "NapiModulesMap | undefined",
          "summary": "[optional] the napiModule which is called in lynx-core. key is module-name, value is esm url.",
          "kind": "property"
        },
        {
          "name": "nativeModulesMap",
          "type": "NativeModulesMap | undefined",
          "summary": "[optional] use to customize NativeModules. key is module-name, value is esm url.\nA `LynxConsoleModule` whose factory returns a Console-like object provides\nthe lexical `console` for this view's background bundles.",
          "kind": "property"
        },
        {
